Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:13.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:13.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们好呀
